0..77 Comment "// Strings joined with `std.string`\'s `concat`, its unit `empty` and the test"
78..91 Comment "// `isEmpty`."
92..94 Comment "//"
95..170 Comment "// The functions read the native `string` namespace, so a program joins the"
171..246 Comment "// builtin `String` the checker and both executors already hold. The module"
247..296 Comment "// states the monoid laws of joining beside them."
297..299 Comment "//"
300..374 Comment "// Each item runs one function on literals and states its answer. The laws"
375..446 Comment "// themselves are certified in the module, over joining presented as an"
447..460 Comment "// operation."
461..463 Comment "//"
464..535 Comment "// - see: `library/std/src/string.gandr` — the functions and the laws"
536..613 Comment "// - see: `pathological/strings/joining.gandr` — a law over the definition,"
614..626 Comment "//   refused"
627..676 Comment "// - see: #525 — admits a law over a definition"
